title: "Rehab-HandballVR: kinematic recordings from a virtual reality adapted handball serious game for upper limb rehabilitation"
abstract: "Kinematic recordings and performance metrics of nine participants across two exercises of an adapted handball serious game in virtual reality, collected in an experimental session at the Hospital Nacional de Parapléjicos (Toledo, Spain)."
